fsociety kernel 4.19 for POCO F1 (beryllium)
============================================

  Custom Linux 4.19.325 kernel for the Xiaomi POCO F1 (SDM845),
  based on Aozora 4.19 by Kaiyaa77.

Builds
------

  KSU    KernelSU-Next 33219 + SUSFS (KernelSU Next manager v3.3.0)
  NoSU   no root

  Profiles   STD   GPU 710 MHz, thermal on
             OC    GPU 802 MHz, relaxed thermal

4.19 bug fixes
--------------

 - Phone powers off on reboot: warm reboot. Tested 10-15 reboots.
 - USB not detected after replugging: fixed. Tested 10-15 replugs,
   USB and MTP show up right away.
 - Battery drops or shuts off with charge left: fuel-gauge fix
   included, not tested yet.
 - Battery cycle count not fully cleared: fixed.

Other fixes
-----------

 - Chrome/Brave crash on Android 17: CAP_CHECKPOINT_RESTORE backport.
 - Bootloop with newer clang: removed an LTO flag from the Aozora
   Makefile that crashed the kernel at boot.
 - Vibrations of 1 s or longer did nothing: haptics timer typo
   (present in every beryllium kernel).
 - QC2 charging thermal typo: 10.2 A corrected to 1.025 A.
 - Double-tap-to-wake on FocalTech panels: fixed the screen suspend
   order (original LCD).
 - KernelSU-Next + SUSFS: Zygisk detection and modules at cold boot.

Extras
------

 - STD / OC profiles (GPU 710 / 802 MHz and thermal settings).
 - fsociety-control module (WebUI: Standard / Gaming).
 - Clean installer screen, short kernel version text, two builds
   (KSU and NoSU).

Notes
-----

 - For 4.19 ROMs only (not 4.9).
 - The version shows 5.10.245 (Aozora's spoof); the real base is
   4.19.325.
 - Full details: see CHANGELOG.md.

